  "fullDescription": "🔥🍫 A cozy collection of watercolor clipart inspired by classic campfire s’mores, toasted marshmallows, autumn treats, and cozy outdoor moments. Featuring delicious s’mores desserts, chocolate bars, marshmallows, hot cocoa, campfire elements, and charming fall accents, this collection captures the warmth of crisp autumn evenings, cabin getaways, and seasonal baking traditions. Designed in a soft watercolor style with warm earthy tones and modern cozy aesthetics.\n\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Journals and planners\n• Greeting cards and invitations\n• Seasonal baking designs\n• Social media graphics\n• Digital and printable crafts\n• Autumn-themed projects\n• Cozy campfire and cabin designs\n\n🍂 What’s included:\n– 15 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 15 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 15 SVG files\n\n🍫 Included illustrations:\nclassic s’more, toasted marshmallow on stick, stack of marshmallows, chocolate bar, bitten s’more, campfire with marshmallow stick, s’more cookie sandwich, pumpkin spice s’more, hot cocoa with marshmallows, jar of mini marshmallows, cozy knit scarf, maple leaf, acorn pair, tiny pumpkin, campfire lantern etc.\n\n🔥 Inspired by campfire nights, cozy cabins, fall road trips, outdoor adventures, seasonal desserts, autumn baking, and the nostalgic tradition of making s’mores around the fire. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting, and comforting designs that celebrate the sweetest moments of fall.",
